decision follows the dissolution of Parliament and widespread unrest fueled by corruption and political grievances.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/south-asia/nepal-interim-government-who-is-sushila-karki-first-woman-to-serve-as-prime-minister/articleshow/123854160.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/south-asia/nepal-interim-government-who-is-sushila-karki-first-woman-to-serve-as-prime-minister/articleshow/123854160.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-12T20:14:11+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI News Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123854298,imgsize-564433.cms"/></item><item><title>Who is Tyler Robinson? Suspect arrested over Charlie Kirk’s murder</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123854035.cms" /&gt;Tyler Robinson, a 22-year-old from Utah, has been apprehended in connection with the assassination of conservative activist Charlie Kirk. President Trump confirmed the arrest, stating the suspect was identified and turned in by an acquaintance. Kirk was fatally shot while addressing a crowd at Utah Valley University, prompting a massive investigation and outpouring of tips.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/who-is-tyler-robinson-suspect-arrested-over-charlie-kirks-murder/articleshow/123854035.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/who-is-tyler-robinson-suspect-arrested-over-charlie-kirks-murder/articleshow/123854035.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-12T19:35:54+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123854753,imgsize-1090354.cms"/></item><item><title>Driving in Saudi Arabia: 48 countries approved for license conversion; how to apply and what to do if yours isn’t on the list</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123851901.cms" /&gt;New to Saudi Arabia and planning to drive? If your foreign license is from one of 48 approved countries, you can convert it without a driving test. Others must attend driving school and pass exams. This guide covers eligibility, required documents, fees, medical checks, and step-by-step instructions to help expats smoothly get their Saudi driving license.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/driving-in-saudi-arabia-48-countries-approved-for-license-conversion-how-to-apply-and-what-to-do-if-yours-isnt-on-the-list/articleshow/123851901.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/driving-in-saudi-arabia-48-countries-approved-for-license-conversion-how-to-apply-and-what-to-do-if-yours-isnt-on-the-list/articleshow/123851901.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-12T19:14:10+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123853936,imgsize-1120356.cms"/></item><item><title>'Father of justice': Who is Matt Robinson, Charlie Kirk shooter Tyler Robinson's dad who turned him in?</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123853877.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/father-of-justice-who-is-matt-robinson-charlie-kirk-shooter-tyler-robinsons-dad-who-turned-in-him/articleshow/123853877.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/father-of-justice-who-is-matt-robinson-charlie-kirk-shooter-tyler-robinsons-dad-who-turned-in-him/articleshow/123853877.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-12T19:09:08+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123853873,imgsize-23246.cms"/></item><item><title>What is Iqama? The residency permit every expat in Saudi Arabia can’t live without</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123853416.cms" /&gt;The Iqama is Saudi Arabia’s official residency permit for foreign nationals, issued by the Ministry of Interior. It allows expatriates to live and work legally in the Kingdom, access essential services like banking and healthcare, and sponsor family members. Required shortly after arrival, the Iqama is crucial for legal residency, employment, and day-to-day life in Saudi Arabia.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/what-is-iqama-the-residency-permit-every-expat-in-saudi-arabia-cant-live-without/articleshow/123853416.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/what-is-iqama-the-residency-permit-every-expat-in-saudi-arabia-cant-live-without/articleshow/123853416.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-12T18:53:10+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123853600,imgsize-1071313.cms"/></item><item><title>Who is Anastasia Casey? No one knows if the writer of 'The Shooting of Charlie Kirk' is a real person</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123852890.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/who-is-anastasia-casey-no-one-knows-if-the-writer-of-the-shooting-of-charlie-kirk-is-a-real-person/articleshow/123852890.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/who-is-anastasia-casey-no-one-knows-if-the-writer-of-the-shooting-of-charlie-kirk-is-a-real-person/articleshow/123852890.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-12T18:16:43+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123852975,imgsize-36328.cms"/></item><item><title>‘Charlie has become the America’s greatest martyr to free speech’: Charlie Kirk’s X handle mourns his death</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123851417.cms" /&gt;Conservative activist Charlie Kirk was assassinated during a debate on free speech at Utah Valley University. His death, framed as a martyrdom for free expression, has ignited debates over political violence and polarization in the U.S. Turning Point USA now faces a leadership vacuum and heightened security concerns amidst calls for renewed activism.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/charlie-has-become-the-americas-greatest-martyr-to-free-speech-charlie-kirks-x-handle-mourns-his-death/articleshow/123851417.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/charlie-has-become-the-americas-greatest-martyr-to-free-speech-charlie-kirks-x-handle-mourns-his-death/articleshow/123851417.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-12T17:01:26+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123851408,imgsize-102770.cms"/></item></channel></rss>